Thin-oxide gate, drain and contact currents varying igcmod
* Provenance: original Sansho R17 circuit with synthetic parameters.
* sweep: igcmod 0 1
.param probe=0
Vd d 0 0.95
Vg g 0 .8
Ve e 0 0
Vb b 0 .1
M1 d g 0 e b dev l=.48u w=2.4u
.model dev nmos(level=10 version=4.4 tox=2.1n tsi=75n tbox=105n nch=1.1e17 k1=.42 vth0=.48 u0=.047 aigc=.021 bigc=.001 aigsd=.023 bigsd=.001 dlcig=14n igcmod={probe})
.dc Vg -1.4 1.6 .05
.save i(Vg) i(Vb) i(Vd)
.end
